e 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid b497bd3b-b5a4-5e30-b85a-a0e7e411761f)) (text "No current driver, HV router, differential compliance circuit, independent watchdog, MCU or PCB is completed here." (at 101.6 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 346b1638-4b92-5130-99a8-cea8f074299b)) (text "Q=-10k*22n/40*(V_end-V_start); 600nC=109.091mV nominal. Take BASELINE, CATH, ANODE, NET/TAIL endpoints." (at 101.6 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 04d251a1-cbdf-5849-bed6-aed04d97a7c0)) (text "Cathodic and anodic charges remain separate. Opposed phases can cancel: final net alone cannot qualify delivery." (at 101.6 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 05031340-7f88-5f28-8e0c-589964a35d56)) (text "Actual current-tail/window evidence is required. Command edges, the comparator or an ideal16-bit LSB do not certify precision." (at 101.6 292.1 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid df5bdffe-0913-5820-9a36-84f8a211f85c)) (text "CLRN = HI_OK AND LO_OK AND EXT_SUP_OK. Any low latches Q off; rising REARM admits only while CLRN is high." (at 101.6 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid ef0cb57d-747c-5eee-8ab9-461bd97c577c)))
